WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.062 --> 00:00:10.924
"Stop complaining, Roxy," Cozlin said as they took off.

2
00:00:10.925 --> 00:00:16.440
"A million light-years sounds far, but we have a Delkorian power crystal.

3
00:00:16.441 --> 00:00:20.169
So the trip will actually be pretty quick."

4
00:00:20.170 --> 00:00:28.496
"Okay," Roxy said, yawning.

5
00:00:28.497 --> 00:00:31.992
They took a short nap in the spaceship's sleeping pods.

6
00:00:31.993 --> 00:00:38.130
When they woke up, they were passing by a huge nebula.

7
00:00:38.131 --> 00:00:41.607
An hour later they reached the Varda Region.

8
00:00:41.608 --> 00:00:45.011
Cozlin pressed a button, and a map appeared.

9
00:00:45.012 --> 00:00:51.261
"The spaceship's computer knows the location of every object in the region," Cozlin said.

10
00:00:51.262 --> 00:00:58.914
She leaned closer. "Hmm. Something is wrong with one of the planets."

11
00:00:58.915 --> 00:01:04.476
Roxy saw that one planet—a bright green one—was blinking on the map.

12
00:01:04.477 --> 00:01:07.695
Cozlin tapped the planet, causing it to expand.

13
00:01:07.696 --> 00:01:10.711
"Planet Groon," a voice said.

14
00:01:10.712 --> 00:01:17.059
"Located in the Varda Region, Groon is a forest planet with a large population.

15
00:01:17.060 --> 00:01:20.814
The entire surface is covered in trees.

16
00:01:20.815 --> 00:01:25.528
Groonians spend much of their time growing fruit trees."

17
00:01:25.529 --> 00:01:28.691
"That sounds like a nice place," Roxy said.

18
00:01:28.692 --> 00:01:32.662
"Yep," Cozlin said.

19
00:01:32.663 --> 00:01:39.755
"But not anymore. The sensors aren't picking up any signs of life!"

20
00:01:39.756 --> 00:01:43.141
They flew to Groon and didn't see anything green at all.

21
00:01:43.142 --> 00:01:49.334
Instead, metal structures, along with parts from spaceships and other machines, covered the surface.

22
00:01:49.335 --> 00:01:55.357
"It's as if the entire planet has been turned into a big junkyard!" Roxy said.

23
00:01:55.358 --> 00:01:59.625
"It's been overrun by robots," Cozlin said.

24
00:01:59.626 --> 00:02:03.833
"Maybe the robots on Delkor came from here."

25
00:02:03.834 --> 00:02:07.906
In the distance they saw a small sphere stuck to the planet.

26
00:02:07.907 --> 00:02:12.999
"That looks like a moon," Roxy said.

27
00:02:13.000 --> 00:02:16.443
They landed near the sphere and stepped outside.

28
00:02:16.444 --> 00:02:20.275
Roxy's feet clinked on the metal surface. "I

29
00:02:20.276 --> 00:02:24.585
can't believe there was once a forest under here." Cozlin

30
00:02:24.586 --> 00:02:27.393
nodded but didn't say anything. Roxy

31
00:02:27.394 --> 00:02:29.681
knew why. "She's

32
00:02:29.682 --> 00:02:33.934
scared this will happen to Delkor," Roxy thought. "I

33
00:02:33.935 --> 00:02:35.857
know I'm far from home. But

34
00:02:35.858 --> 00:02:38.760
this is where I need to be right now. Cozlin

35
00:02:38.761 --> 00:02:41.973
needs me!" They

36
00:02:41.974 --> 00:02:46.720
walked past all sorts of strange objects. Some

37
00:02:46.721 --> 00:02:49.910
looked like rockets or satellites. Others

38
00:02:49.911 --> 00:02:54.064
appeared to be vehicles or just scraps of metal. "Where

39
00:02:54.065 --> 00:02:58.230
did all of this come from?" Roxy said. Cozlin

40
00:02:58.231 --> 00:03:05.880
shrugged. "Other planets?" They

41
00:03:05.881 --> 00:03:10.230
found an entrance with a walkway that went down into the planet. As

42
00:03:10.231 --> 00:03:16.005
Roxy examined the metal surrounding the entrance, she gasped. "Here's

43
00:03:16.006 --> 00:03:21.690
an M , just like on all the robots back on Delkor!"

44
00:03:21.691 --> 00:03:26.955
"Wow," Cozlin said. "Then we really are in the right place.

45
00:03:26.956 --> 00:03:30.679
Let's go in!" She took out a device.

46
00:03:30.680 --> 00:03:40.389
"This can detect life. If anyone is in here, we'll know."

47
00:03:40.390 --> 00:03:44.143
They went down the walkway.

48
00:03:44.144 --> 00:03:48.167
Cozlin's device beeped regularly as it scanned the environment.

49
00:03:48.168 --> 00:03:51.657
Up ahead, Roxy saw something strange.

50
00:03:51.658 --> 00:03:54.832
A shimmering energy shield filled the corridor.

51
00:03:54.833 --> 00:03:59.922
She could see that the corridor continued on the other side of the shield.

52
00:03:59.923 --> 00:04:03.903
Cozlin stuck her hand through the energy shield.

53
00:04:03.904 --> 00:04:09.177
She shrugged. "I think it's safe."

54
00:04:09.178 --> 00:04:14.080
They stepped through it and continued to walk.

55
00:04:14.081 --> 00:04:17.460
Cozlin's device wasn't beeping anymore.

56
00:04:17.461 --> 00:04:22.081
Roxy glanced over. "I think your device stopped—"

57
00:04:22.082 --> 00:04:25.044
"Uh-oh!" Cozlin said, pointing ahead.

58
00:04:25.045 --> 00:04:29.102
Roxy looked and saw three mean-looking robots.

59
00:04:29.103 --> 00:04:35.685
"I'll get them!" Roxy tried to fire her eye laser beams, but nothing happened.

60
00:04:35.686 --> 00:04:43.930
"Oh no!" Roxy cried. "I don't have my super powers!"

